  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your inner strength buttresses your skin with the strength of steel.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Untwisting Iron Skin<sup>ISC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While you are using Perfect Style, you increase the damage reduction you gain by 1 and also add your mythic tier to your level for the purpose of determining your DR/adamantine (maximum 10). If you gain DR/─ from breaking an object with hardness of 10 or greater, you add your mythic tier to the number of rounds you retain that damage reduction (maximum 20). If a creature uses an ability against you that allows it to bypass damage reduction that would normally apply, such as a paladin’s smite evil or a mythic champion’s fleet charge, you can expend one use of your mythic power as an immediate action to retain your damage reduction against that creature until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc140\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
